ValueSet: MyCorePathologyLoinc
Id: pathology-loinc-my-core
Title: "MY Core Pathology LOINC Codes"
Description: """NATIONAL SELECTION. The LOINC codes that the Malaysian Pathology Catalogue maps to — 1,536 of the 2,934 orderable tests in pathology-orderable-my-core. Mapping of the remaining tests is in progress and is released as it is completed.

The national orderable code remains the operational key for pathology; this value set is the LOINC side of the catalogue, for systems that exchange LOINC. Codes are published without display names: LOINC display text is maintained by Regenstrief and a terminology server holding LOINC supplies it on expansion."""
